<p><strong>Example 24</strong> - Pausing a running job</p>
<h4 id="resuming-a-paused-job" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#resuming-a-paused-job">§</a> Resuming a paused job</h4>
<p>User can resume a paused job with the following API call. The returned response is the same as the <a href="#job-response">job status response</a> with the job status as <code>running</code>.</p>
