<p><strong>Example 25</strong> - Resuming a paused job</p>
<h4 id="canceling-a-job" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#canceling-a-job">§</a> Canceling a job</h4>
<p>User can cancel a job with the following API call. The returned response is the same as the <a href="#job-response">job status response</a> with the job status as <code>canceled</code>.</p>
<pre class="hljs"><code>
https://harmony.earthdata.nasa.gov/jobs/&lt;job-id&gt;/cancel

